@startuml lifecycle-state
title Glimpse lifecycle (PRD section 5) — states are srt GLIMPSE_STATE codes

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #444444
}

[*] --> PROVISIONING : Ed submits\ncompany name + prospect email

PROVISIONING --> DRAFT : all steps succeeded\n(repos, Workers, D1, Routes,\nAccess app, Hello World deployed)
PROVISIONING --> FAILED : a step failed\n(partial resources flagged)
FAILED --> PROVISIONING : Ed resumes\n(idempotent steps)

DRAFT --> PENDING : Ed clicks "Notify prospect"\nnotified_at = activated_at = now\nexpires_at = now + 7d\ndelete_at = now + 30d\nprospect email added to Access policy\nportal.upsert_glimpse(active = true)

state "Prospect can view (active)" as Active {
  PENDING --> APPROVED : prospect approves\n(portal: decision_log APPROVED\n-> admin.record_decision)
  PENDING --> DECLINED : prospect declines
  PENDING --> DELAYED : prospect "I need more time"\n(portal: decision_log DELAYED\n-> admin.extend; clocks reset)
  APPROVED --> DECLINED : later decline
  DECLINED --> APPROVED : later approve
  APPROVED --> DELAYED : "I need more time"
  DECLINED --> DELAYED : "I need more time"
  DELAYED --> APPROVED : approve
  DELAYED --> DECLINED : decline
  DELAYED --> DELAYED : "I need more time" again\n(clocks reset each time)
}

Active --> EXPIRED : cron: EXPIRE job at expires_at\nprospect removed from Access policy\nportal.upsert_glimpse(active = false)\ncontent, Workers, repos untouched

EXPIRED --> DELAYED : prospect "I need more time"\n(portal -> admin.extend)\nactivated_at = now, expires_at = +7d,\ndelete_at = +30d, Access restored
EXPIRED --> PENDING : Ed Reactivate\n(same clock reset, Access restored)

EXPIRED --> DELETED : cron: DELETE job at delete_at
Active --> DELETED : Ed requests deletion\n(from APPROVED or DECLINED)
EXPIRED --> DELETED : Ed requests deletion

DELETED --> [*]

note right of DELETED
  Both private repos deleted; Workers, Routes,
  D1, Access app removed;
  portal.upsert_glimpse(deleted = true).
  Terminal: a returning prospect gets a
  new glimpse with a new id.
end note

note bottom of Active
  The state is the prospect's latest action.
  All four keep full prospect access until
  expires_at; both clocks run from the most
  recent activation (notify, reactivate, extend).
end note
@enduml
